CI workflow declared in .github/workflows/ci.yml

name: CI Pipeline
jobs:
  validate:
    steps:
      - Checkout Code
      - Set up Python 3.11
      - Install dependencies
      - Run lint (Syntax Check)
        python -m py_compile app/app.py app/test_app.py
      - Run unit tests
        pytest app/test_app.py
      - Set up Docker Buildx
      - Build Docker Image (Dry Run)
        docker/build-push-action@v5

This repository does not contain the output artifact from a real GitHub Actions run in the workspace, so the static workflow definition plus the local equivalent test execution are the available validation evidence.
